                  "value": "Haenen, A., Frielink, N., van Ool, J., Tan, F. I., & Embregts, P. J. (2023). Exploring the experiences of self‐determination of individuals with mild intellectual disabilities and epilepsy. Journal of Applied Research in Intellectual Disabilities, 36(6), 1326-1336."
